    card is Link Summoned: You can send 1 Level 2 monster from your Deck to the GY.
    If another monster is Special Summoned while this card is on the field (except
    during the Damage Step): You can detach 1 material from an Xyz Monster you control,
    then target 1 monster on the field; return it to the hand.'
